<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17242" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ex-spes</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expes</span></b> ), adj. (only in the <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>nom. sing.</i>), <i>without hope</i>, <i>hopeless</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in Tac.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(a).</b> With <i>gen.</i>:
			exspes liberūm, Att. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 12,
			7</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac. A.
					6, 24</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense5"><b>(b).</b>
			<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">solus, inops, exspes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 14, 217</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">si fractis enatat exspes Navibus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor. A.
					P. 20</span></i>
			.</div>
